✈️ New poll settings.
You can now add a photo and description to a poll, as well as images for each answer option.

Additional options include:
× Allow selecting multiple answers;
× Allow revoting;
× Shuffle options for each voter;
× Set one or more correct answers;
× Limit poll duration with automatic closing. 

__Telegram Beta for iOS v12.6.0 (32616)__

